/td></tr></tbody></table><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" id="main-content" width="600" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000181DC0C0" style="text-align: center; width: 600px; margin-left: 40px; margin-right: 40px;"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="00000000181DC320"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000181DC580"><td align="center" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000181DC7E0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; text-align: left;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="600" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000181DCC90"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="00000000181DCEF0"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000181DD150"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000181DD3B0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 40px; height: 30px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000181DDBE0"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000181DDE40" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Hi Distribution team,</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000181DE300"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000181DE560" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000181DEA20"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000181DEC80" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">It appears there is a new technical issue based on our initial investigation. The agents have already reported this to their Tech Partner with the case number provided below:<br data_liveedit_tagid="00000000181DB780"><br data_liveedit_tagid="00000000181DEEE0"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 102);">[ COPY - Information from case with all distribution requirements - please include TP case no. TP, PCC, PNR Number, Description]&nbsp;</span><br data_liveedit_tagid="00000000181DF120"><br data_liveedit_tagid="00000000181DF230">Please review this issue for further investigation.<br data_liveedit_tagid="00000000181DF470"><br data_liveedit_tagid="00000000181DF580">Thank you for your attention to this matter.<br data_liveedit_tagid="00000000181DF7C0"><br data_liveedit_tagid="00000000181DF8D0">Kind regards,<br data_liveedit_tagid="00000000181DFB10"><br data_liveedit_tagid="00000000181DFC20"><strong data_liveedit_tagid="00000000181DFE60">Qantas NDC Escalation Support</strong><br data_liveedit_tagid="00000000181E00C0"><em data_liveedit_tagid="00000000181E0300">Qantas Airways Limited</em></font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000181E08F0"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000181E0B50" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000181E1010"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000181E1270" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000181E2D40"><td data_liveedit_tagid="00000000181E2FA0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000181E3200" style="background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246); width: 680px;"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="00000000181E3460"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000181E36C0"><td align="center" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000181E3920" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); li